   "definition_quote": "Let $\\theta$ be drawn from $\\Re^N$ and distributed according to a $N(\\mu_0, \\Sigma_0)$ prior. There is a set of $K$ actions $\\mathcal{A} \\subseteq \\Re^N$. At each time $t = 0,1,\\ldots,T-1$, an action $A_t \\in \\mathcal{A}$ is selected, after which a reward $R_{t+1} = Y_{t+1} = \\theta^\\top A_t + W_{t+1}$ is observed, where $W_{t+1} \\sim N(0, \\sigma^2_w)$."
